{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LC2bGczy4qmrSeXJHsJGzA","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /private/tmp/h-yrDiZe/README.md has been updated successfully."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8a0b7aad-1b9a-4132-9af7-93fbd673c8b9","uuid":"d4bdc4c8-86c3-4153-9a19-fba87f0529de","timestamp":"2026-11-09T19:06:39.383Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/h-yrDiZe/README.md","oldString":"- `codex`: Codex CLI (`codex exec --json`), unsandboxed.\n","newString":"- `codex`: Codex CLI (`codex exec --json`), unsandboxed.\n- `codex-sandbox`: the same Codex run, with the whole `codex` process under\n  `sandbox/agent.sb` as the kimi lane does it: scratch HOME, and\n  `CODEX_HOME` pointed at an empty scratch dir so the real `~/.codex` is never\n  opened. Auth comes from `CODEX_API_KEY` in the environment.\n","originalFile":"# agent-evals\n\nA small harness that runs coding agents on short tasks and keeps everything a\nrun produced, so the runs can be graded and compared later. It lives in\n`~/evals/agent-evals` on the eval Mac.\n\n`./run.sh <task> <lane> [rep]` copies `tasks/<task>/` into a scratch folder in\n`/tmp`, runs the lane's agent there with `tasks/<task>.prompt`, and writes the\nrun folder `runs/<task>-<lane>-r<rep>/`:\n\n- `prompt.txt`, `agent.log` (the agent's JSON event stream), `agent.err`,\n  `meta.json` (exit code, seconds);\n- `final.txt`, the agent's last message, for the Codex lanes;\n- `answer.json`, written by `check_answer.py`: the final answer the graders\n  read (from `final.txt` for Codex, from the event stream for Kimi).\n\nLanes:\n\n- `codex`: Codex CLI (`codex exec --json`), unsandboxed.\n- `kimi`: Kimi Code. Its output goes to Moonshot, so its shell runs under the\n  macOS sandbox profile `sandbox/agent.sb` (no reading or writing the real\n  home), with an empty scratch HOME. Kimi's own install and sessions live in\n  `~/.kimi-code`, which the profile opens.\n\nCodex logs in with an API key from the environment (`CODEX_API_KEY`), so it\nneeds nothing from the home folder.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":17,"oldLines":6,"newStart":17,"newLines":10,"lines":[" Lanes:"," "," - `codex`: Codex CLI (`codex exec --json`), unsandboxed.","+- `codex-sandbox`: the same Codex run, with the whole `codex` process under","+  `sandbox/agent.sb` as the kimi lane does it: scratch HOME, and","+  `CODEX_HOME` pointed at an empty scratch dir so the real `~/.codex` is never","+  opened. Auth comes from `CODEX_API_KEY` in the environment."," - `kimi`: Kimi Code. Its output goes to Moonshot, so its shell runs under the","   macOS sandbox profile `sandbox/agent.sb` (no reading or writing the real","   home), with an empty scratch HOME. Kimi's own install and sessions live in"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01LC2bGczy4qmrSeXJHsJGzA","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
